      "statement": "The backend function `app/main.py` has maxDuration 1800 s in backend/vercel.json, and the CopilotKit proxy route in the frontend declares `maxDuration = 1800`; the two values must be kept equal because Import turns stream through the proxy for 15-20 minutes.",
