      "id": "claim_dda7c963dd984e02a8de90eda93ebc80",
      "statement": "Supabase Storage is accessed only through backend/app/integrations/storage.py over plain httpx REST with the service-role key; it is optional (disabled when SUPABASE_URL or SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY is unset, logging once and returning None/empty) and never raises into research or promotion, so an outage leaves storage_path null instead of failing a run.",
