    {
      "id": "claim_a049d05d4a4c44e28ac222aac71b0591",
      "statement": "Storage uses the buckets source-archive, org-vault and staff-sources; archive keys are content-addressed (`<url-hash>/<sha256>-<name>`) at fetch and renamed to `funders/<slug>/<year>-<name>` at promotion, while vault keys are `<org_id>/<uuid>-<name>` so the org id leads for RLS; `split` rejects unknown buckets and empty/./.. segments.",
