      "id": "claim_e94d71c681d940caab12dc7cd5b53e8e",
      "statement": "Browser uploads to the Doc Vault go directly to Supabase Storage through a backend-minted signed upload URL (valid 2 hours) because Vercel Functions cap request bodies at a few MB; signed download URLs default to 10 minutes, archive uploads over 50 MB are refused client-side, and a duplicate upload (reported by Supabase as HTTP 400 with statusCode 409) counts as success.",
