      "id": "claim_a22103cbcba642658419f8576a1a6395",
      "statement": "Langfuse tracing is enabled only when both public and secret keys are set; it falls back to VERCEL_ENV and VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA for environment and release, attaches a payload mask before agents are built, verifies credentials at boot (disabling tracing with an error if rejected), never takes the app down on failure, and flushes after each agent run because serverless functions freeze after responding.",
